{"id":"1048d44b28527ff2","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md","title":"ZFC Model7 Premouse","display":"df-zfc-model7-premouse — ZFC Model7 Premouse","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model7-premouse","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model7-premouse"],"display":"df-zfc-model7-premouse — ZFC Model7 Premouse","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model7-premouse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model7-premouse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model7-premouse — ZFC Model7 Premouse"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab819650b6d5d52d\" href=\"?note=ab819650b6d5d52d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,M,\\vec E\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal M,M,\\vec E\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Premouse}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Premouse}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> is the canonical premouse predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab819650b6d5d52d\" href=\"?note=ab819650b6d5d52d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}premouse} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists M,\\vec E\\in V\\;(\\mathcal M=\\langle M,\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}premouse} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists M,\\vec E\\in V\\;(\\mathcal M=\\langle M,\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical premouse predicate already contains extender coherence, amenability, acceptability, and fine structure; duplicating two partial wrappers weakened the definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"ab819650b6d5d52d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"ab819650b6d5d52d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Premouse}_S\\subseteq V^2$ is the canonical premouse predicate (see [[../batch18/58-df-zfc-mouse-premouse.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal M,M,\\vec E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Premouse}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}premouse} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists M,\\vec E\\in V\\;(\\mathcal M=\\langle M,\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{Premouse}_S(M,\\vec E))","display":true}],"bytes":946,"backli